# M1: Maya with Strata v0.2.6's arithmetic; M2: Maya's own defaults (all rounding-level by Maya's account; the KL step
# checks them) minus the PCIe lane (not repeatable run to run). Lossy switches are never set (DS4_YOCO_KEEP,
# *_DISK_SKIP_W, *_RAM_SKIP_W, DS4_INDEX_TC); MAYA_DS4_PROMPT_SKIP explicit in both (a STRATA_ name would leak in).
M_COMMON = {"MAYA_DS4_SLOT_KEEP": "0", "MAYA_DS4_STREAM": "0", "STRATA_SERVER_LOG": "0", "DS4_LANE_CAL": "none",
            "DS4_FLOW_STATS": "1"}
